Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,《狂蟒之灾3：魂泣山溪》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.06,0:01:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.50,0:01:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the kind of research you expected, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.20,0:01:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit back and enjoy the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.83,0:02:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a shot in his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.20,0:02:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord, have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.98,0:02:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.42,0:02:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.46,0:02:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad you came, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.06,0:02:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you wanted to be rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.00,0:02:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad you made yourself comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.69,0:03:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.03,0:03:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,God help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.29,0:05:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what you're stating is that Wexel Hall Pharmaceuticals...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:29.38,Default,,0,0,0 ,,...have denied knowledge of genetic testing...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:32.32,Default,,0,0,0 ,,...on animals at their secret labs in Eastern Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.49,0:05:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that CEO J.D. Murdoch personally contacted Peter...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.43,0:05:39.37,Default,,0,0,0 ,,...to deny these claims, we feel gave total credence...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.53,0:05:43.10,Default,,0,0,0 ,,...to the leak that testing was more inhumane than we have ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.40,0:05:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you be more specific without divulging your informants?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.37,0:05:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Our sources reported and I quote:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,"The testing we witnessed is more cruel, more grotesquely evil...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.65,0:05:57.24,Default,,0,0,0 ,,...than the American people could ever imagine. "
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.29,0:06:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Mr. Murdoch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.86,0:06:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Mr. Murdoch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.53,0:06:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Mr. Murdoch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.08,0:06:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.71,0:06:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Mr. Murdoch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Handshake says a lot about a man, Pinkus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.55,0:06:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.36,0:06:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I get you a cup of coffee, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.37,0:06:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the pleasantries.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.67,0:06:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There's been a leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.24,0:06:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,A leak?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.41,0:06:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,PETA.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.67,0:06:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,People for the Ethical Treatment of Animals...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...have launched an inquiry with public relations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.08,0:07:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Where exactly is our facility and what exactly are we doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.28,0:07:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm asking myself, "How did they find out about us?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.02,0:07:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can assure you, Mr. Murdoch. I will find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.66,0:07:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the public face of Wexel Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.29,0:07:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,When that face is damaged...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.23,0:07:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- I am damaged. - I understand, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention that every drug company in the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.33,0:07:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,...is crawling up our ass, trying to beat us to the finish line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.64,0:07:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I could double security but until we've identified the source...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- it would be pointless. - It is your job!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And you will do your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.61,0:07:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Or the only thing you'll be supervising is a proctologist...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.55,0:07:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,...removing my boot from your rectum. Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.45,0:07:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the status of the project?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.82,0:07:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We've hit some delays.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.29,0:07:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You've hit some delays. Now why is it I'm not surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What sort of delays?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.39,0:07:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kane will answer all your questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.40,0:07:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Kane?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.34,0:07:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Just this way, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a live feed of the queen anaconda's tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.35,0:08:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Completely motionless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like my first wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.05,0:08:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let her slumber fool you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.25,0:08:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,She's 1200 pounds of pure crushing power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.52,0:08:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,As I said, just like my first wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.46,0:08:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Good to see you, Mr. Murdoch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.43,0:08:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting you until next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor, as you know, I'm a man in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Our staff's been working around the clock...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.34,0:08:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I'm fully aware of your schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.54,0:08:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Because I'm paying you for results.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.71,0:08:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know, we have successfully synthesized and produced...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.14,0:08:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,...a blood-orchid extract.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.61,0:08:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Our patient tolerates the serum just like snakes in the wild do...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.72,0:08:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...with zero negative side effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.39,0:08:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And no signs of aging.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.65,0:08:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The synthetic serum is fully efficacious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, at present only in snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.59,0:08:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is something you must see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.23,0:08:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.77,0:09:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.11,0:09:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But tell me, what is it that snakes have that we don't have?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.91,0:09:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have not determined why the extract is non-toxic in the snake...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.58,0:09:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,...but lethal in humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.32,0:09:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But you told me you had made some progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There has been. We've reduced but not eliminated the toxicity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.03,0:09:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- In dogs and in chimpanzees. - Even mice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.36,0:09:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Mice administered a steady dose of the serum...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.86,0:09:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,...show signs of a reduced rate of aging.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.97,0:09:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But ultimately, they die...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.61,0:09:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...from some mechanism we don't fully understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.18,0:09:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Murdoch, this is Darryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.08,0:09:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Darryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.42,0:09:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.85,0:09:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- This way, sir. - Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.76,0:09:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.79,0:09:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the bottom line, Mr. Murdoch...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.99,0:10:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,...is that we've developed a second-generation serum...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,...by producing a new strain of the orchid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.40,0:10:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We hope to solve the problem at the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.61,0:10:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the miracle of modern science.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.85,0:10:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the miracle? I can't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.15,0:10:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We keep it dark to create an artificial sleep cycle for the creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.60,0:10:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugly son of a bitch, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.07,0:10:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.33,0:10:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a typical anaconda.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.50,0:10:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It certainly isn't typical now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.85,0:10:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- How's my baby doing today? - He's hungry again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.12,0:11:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's the ambient temp of the cage? - Sixty-five.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.69,0:11:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's cozy it up five degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.39,0:11:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And increase the cynanol mix by 20 cc's.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.53,0:11:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.73,0:11:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me a regular dosage of serum is what's produced this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.83,0:11:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,For the most part, we wanted to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.04,0:11:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing. Four months ago, he could fit in a shoebox.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.14,0:11:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's probably how he feels right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.07,0:11:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Suits are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.44,0:11:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know. And I intend to find out why.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.05,0:11:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, quite the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.88,0:11:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bigger, faster, stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.22,0:11:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And a hell of a lot meaner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.38,0:11:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We're making progress but we need larger tanks and additional security.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.19,0:11:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- I was getting to that. - Were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.63,0:11:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Murdoch, our herpetologist, Dr. Amanda Hayes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.30,0:11:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've submitted four requests to Pinkus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.36,0:11:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And every time his answer is, "It's not my call."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.97,0:11:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So whose call is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.50,0:11:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yours, Mr. Murdoch?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.84,0:11:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Please excuse Dr. Hayes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.81,0:11:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not familiar with the protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very familiar with the protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.61,0:11:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing what you pay me for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.18,0:12:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Minding the well-being of our reptiles and watching our asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Hayes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.95,0:12:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You give me a marketable product...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I will buy you the biggest animal park this side of the equator.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.62,0:12:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We need larger facilities now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.99,0:12:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.26,0:12:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to do better than that. You're not handling 60-foot snakes...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.66,0:12:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...with massive appetites.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.03,0:12:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We are understaffed and in way over our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.17,0:12:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What does she mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.28,0:12:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me, gentlemen, I have some cultures to examine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.42,0:12:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinkus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's nothing. - Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.92,0:12:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm paying you an obscene amount of money to keep this research on track.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.73,0:12:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It is clearly not on track.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And my very expensive expert there is concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.20,0:12:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Money is not the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.64,0:12:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If we stopped every time we needed to expand or upgrade...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.47,0:12:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,...we'd be months behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything here is custom-made. It takes time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And time is what I do not have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.19,0:13:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Amanda? Excuse us. - Sir? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.79,0:13:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't go to med school to serve a life sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.69,0:13:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a means to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.53,0:13:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose end? For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.93,0:13:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So some sick billionaire can defeat death?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.43,0:13:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do you mean he's sick? - Come on, Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.01,0:13:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Pupils dilated, pale skin, coughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.74,0:13:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention his severe weight loss?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.04,0:13:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks to me like he's got cancer, which means he's dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.11,0:13:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We're at the brink of saving millions of lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.12,0:13:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you imagine a drug that could revitalize cancer patients...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.26,0:13:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...and reverse Alzheimer's?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.42,0:13:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really still believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.93,0:13:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.60,0:13:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.36,0:14:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,For something that's supposed to be so good, why does it feel wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.60,0:14:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew what we were doing when we started the research.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.44,0:14:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I expected it to be handled with more responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.84,0:14:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're tampering with evolution, Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.81,0:14:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. It's just a big snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.48,0:14:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, that's definitely an understatement.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.52,0:14:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- All right, I'll talk to you later, okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Bigger, tougher, meaner, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.70,0:14:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I could use a bit of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.07,0:14:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a good idea, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.14,0:14:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me the serum is responsible for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.78,0:14:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir? Sir, turn that light off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.35,0:14:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn that light off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.92,0:14:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.89,0:14:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinkus? The warning lights in the tank are starting to go crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.76,0:14:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's going on? - I told you not to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.39,0:15:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hit the gas. - What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.96,0:15:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's going on? - More lights are flashing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.73,0:15:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.83,0:15:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't you touch that gas! - Darryl, hit the goddamn gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.14,0:15:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're gonna kill it. - No, we're not killing...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.17,0:15:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't put the gas on. - Please, Darryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.14,0:15:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hit the goddamn gas. Sir. Sir. - I won't let you kill it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.85,0:15:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down. It will only sedate the snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.95,0:15:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you tell me what...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.38,0:15:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Darryl! Darryl? - What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.02,0:15:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's happening? - Darryl...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.49,0:15:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look. Don't worry, Mr. Murdoch. That's three-inch polycarbonate glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.66,0:15:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.80,0:15:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's it doing? - Everybody, just stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.30,0:15:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- The gas will sedate it. - Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll settle down, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.37,0:15:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.85,0:15:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.15,0:15:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.05,0:16:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's just leave him be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.82,0:16:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Darryl, call Kane.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.89,0:16:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.39,0:16:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call the technicians to get this repaired.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.37,0:16:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- Darryl. Hit the alarm. Lock us down. - Hit the alarm! Hit the alarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.40,0:16:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Loading results...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.17,0:16:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay calm. Everyone outside. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.18,0:16:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- We're safe. - We gotta help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.81,0:16:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- What? Screw him. - He's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.61,0:16:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- There's a monster out there! - I've got to help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.45,0:16:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If the snake doesn't get you, the gas will!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.15,0:16:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.22,0:16:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.33,0:16:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- What happened? - What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.10,0:16:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do? Where's Darryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.16,0:16:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Darryl didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.03,0:16:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We've gotta go. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.34,0:16:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- You said the gas would knock it out. - He's looking for a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.67,0:16:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to contain him. Security, lockdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.24,0:16:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Full lockdown. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.78,0:16:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm locking down right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.05,0:17:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanda, get the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.38,0:17:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey. Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.95,0:17:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm getting Murdoch out of here. - Nobody's going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.82,0:17:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab a gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.89,0:17:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- No way. I'm getting out of here. - Pinkus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.66,0:17:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.80,0:17:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.13,0:17:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All personnel should exit immediately to your designated safety zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.64,0:17:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.11,0:17:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- The sedatives must have taken effect. - Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That stuff would knock out 10 rhinos.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.05,0:17:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a stun gas. It will only last for five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.79,0:17:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time. Get the masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.99,0:17:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinkus? Escort Mr. Murdoch out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.69,0:17:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah. Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.96,0:17:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.93,0:17:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All personnel should exit immediately to your designated safety zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.47,0:17:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Get out. - This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.31,0:18:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All personnel should exit immediately to your designated safety zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.61,0:18:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Have you seen Janet? Is she outside? - She's already gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.95,0:18:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.61,0:18:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All personnel should exit immediately to your designated safety zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.22,0:18:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.09,0:18:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All personnel should exit immediately to your designated safety zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.77,0:18:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.50,0:18:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,All personnel should exit immediately to your designated safety zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.54,0:18:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.78,0:18:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.41,0:18:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,All personnel...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.39,0:18:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.62,0:18:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All personnel should exit immediately to your designated safety zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.96,0:18:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.70,0:18:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.46,0:18:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's Darryl. - All personnel should exit...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.60,0:19:01.86,Default,,0,0,0 ,,...to your designated safety zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.04,0:19:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you okay? - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.44,0:19:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's get through this. - This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.81,0:19:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All personnel should exit to your designated safety zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.61,0:19:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.41,0:19:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.28,0:19:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- All personnel should exit... - Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.49,0:19:20.35,Default,,0,0,0 ,,...to your designated safety zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.05,0:19:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.66,0:19:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.36,0:19:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where would he go? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.13,0:19:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But we better find it fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.63,0:19:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone after the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.16,0:19:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's go. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not a drill. All personnel...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.37,0:19:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we gonna explain that one, huh, Pinkus?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.41,0:19:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you haven't got a backup lighting system.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.15,0:19:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.55,0:19:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It should come on in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.28,0:19:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here quickly. Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.44,0:20:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.21,0:20:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate when you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.58,0:20:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.95,0:20:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Susan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.59,0:21:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He broke her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.52,0:21:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.57,0:21:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.04,0:22:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you any idea what this is gonna cost to cover?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.55,0:22:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.82,0:22:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, yes. I know exactly...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.42,0:22:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I want this place cleaned!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.15,0:22:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I want it cleaned properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.19,0:22:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir? Might I advise that we can still salvage this situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.13,0:22:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,On-site security team is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.79,0:22:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a team of professional trackers on their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.53,0:22:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll do whatever you have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.67,0:22:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But you will be with them 24 hours a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.64,0:22:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do you mean, sir? - You're a supervisor, Pinkus.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.54,0:22:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Supervise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.04,0:23:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I will have them test that serum on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.98,0:23:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But, sir, I don't do field work.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.95,0:23:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I want news, Pinkus.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.89,0:23:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Good news. - Pinkus.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.59,0:23:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Name's Grozny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.66,0:23:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Until I hear good news, you will report to me hourly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.20,0:23:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.54,0:23:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Grozny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.14,0:23:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.01,0:23:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll brief you on the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.52,0:23:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys. It took five shots to bring them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.59,0:23:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll give you 20 at market rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.83,0:23:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, guys. I don't care what kinky plans you're into.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.86,0:24:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But these are 5-pound Java rhino horns.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.23,0:24:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So I suggest you go to an ATM teller.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.50,0:24:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,One that dispenses some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.47,0:24:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty thousand or nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.19,0:24:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.83,0:24:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Always a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.97,0:24:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.81,0:24:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us the envelope.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.51,0:24:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. I got $30,000 in crisp American bills.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.71,0:24:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you want euros you'll have to go to Greece or a bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.68,0:24:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I get them confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.45,0:24:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm... Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.99,0:25:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Pinkus?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.13,0:25:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a little busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.96,0:25:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.90,0:25:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.63,0:25:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't reinforce the cages and the snakes got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.67,0:25:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.94,0:25:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We are prepared to pay and I need you here to lead the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.88,0:25:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'll be there as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.68,0:25:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.68,0:25:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's your name? - Florin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.38,0:25:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Florin?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.92,0:25:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's for you. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.47,0:25:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Always know the animal before the hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.72,0:26:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,These creatures are one of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.43,0:26:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Growing to become 60 feet long. - Sixty-foot snakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.43,0:26:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- I've got one of those. - Dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.27,0:26:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.94,0:26:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They are fast and very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.17,0:26:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Having never dealt with anything like this, I urge you to use extreme caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.45,0:26:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We must bring them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.05,0:26:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It is imperative.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.92,0:26:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- And they are more than 60 feet... - Thank you, Dr. Hayes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.45,0:26:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I will handle this briefing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.25,0:26:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My team know these woods like our own backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.59,0:26:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's easier than that. We also know their location.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.06,0:26:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We try and keep a short leash on our investments.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.23,0:26:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,In case of emergencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.70,0:26:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We're moving out in 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.10,0:26:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hammett's on his way. We should wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.14,0:26:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not waiting. Not when we know where the snakes are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.17,0:26:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to strike fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.04,0:26:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said, we move out in 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.71,0:26:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Man, he wants all the glory. - You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.01,0:27:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how he feels about Hammett.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.92,0:27:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yep. - You heard the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.28,0:27:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.99,0:27:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to speak with you privately.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.12,0:27:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why haven't you called the government?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.19,0:27:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The company is handling this matter privately.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.49,0:27:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Company has no idea what we're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.73,0:27:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I need to remind you that you signed a strict confidentiality contract?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.70,0:27:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There are innocent people that need to be warned.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.37,0:27:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our professionals will resolve this matter swiftly and efficiently.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.91,0:27:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And as for you, take this as a friendly warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.51,0:27:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.01,0:27:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I am responsible for those animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.21,0:27:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody knows their behavior better.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.22,0:27:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Those snakes aren't gonna bask in the sun and roll over for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.82,0:27:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.23,0:27:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the one handling 60-foot snakes with massive appetites.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.53,0:27:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We are understaffed and in way over our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.14,0:27:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you imagine a drug that could revitalize cancer patients...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.27,0:28:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,...and reverse Alzheimer's?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.17,0:28:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.51,0:28:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.08,0:28:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Please excuse Dr. Hayes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.08,0:28:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not familiar with the protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.52,0:28:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Hayes?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.12,0:28:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Hayes?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.03,0:28:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.73,0:28:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You like traveling light?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.37,0:28:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'd feel really comfortable with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.57,0:28:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It would make you comfortable...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.20,0:28:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,...if you came face to face with a 60-foot snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.94,0:28:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I already have, remember? I helped create them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.11,0:28:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, that's why you guys are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.38,0:28:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm giving you the best chance to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.48,0:28:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no problem, Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.55,0:28:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stick with Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.72,0:28:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nick?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.52,0:28:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Introduce her to the bazooka.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.49,0:28:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The bazooka.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.63,0:28:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-four knockouts, regional city champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.51,0:29:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I see that gun again?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.35,0:29:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.49,0:29:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Dragosh...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.53,0:29:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,...they say you should never look them in the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.40,0:29:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And? What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.83,0:29:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They have the powers of mesmerizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.50,0:29:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's bull. - No, no, no, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.51,0:29:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a story of a hunter who stared in the eyes of the anaconda too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.81,0:29:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, he was hypnotized.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.18,0:29:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It swallowed him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.35,0:29:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to stuff this rifle down your throat?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.86,0:29:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be an ass, Andrei. You know he's afraid of snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.59,0:30:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of snakes. I just don't like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.06,0:30:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to like them. You just have to like killing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.37,0:30:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.52,0:30:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn wolves!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.48,0:35:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.15,0:35:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- Got it. - Follow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.12,0:36:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the signal's coming from around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.26,0:36:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be anywhere within 100 yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.16,0:36:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,These bastards detect heat, so you're always prone to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.90,0:36:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.60,0:36:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nick? Andrei? See who's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.34,0:36:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dragosh, check the barn. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.20,0:36:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- You two, around the back. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.04,0:36:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.74,0:36:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- What about us? - Mr. Pinkus. Miss Hayes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.95,0:36:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.81,0:36:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- If they were here, you'd see evidence. - Yeah, you're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.29,0:36:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we're looking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.22,0:36:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Grozny.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.09,0:36:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You may need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.89,0:36:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.61,0:36:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Anybody home?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.78,0:37:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hello? - Try the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.59,0:37:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.12,0:37:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.72,0:37:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like Little House on the Prairie.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.27,0:38:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's check around the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.75,0:38:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.65,0:38:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,...sorry about the professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.25,0:38:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.12,0:38:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.56,0:38:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragosh, it's reading. We're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.50,0:38:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes peeled.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.53,0:38:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,All clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.44,0:38:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I'm going in. I can't wait anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.14,0:38:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You go around back, I'll take front.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.01,0:38:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.74,0:38:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Go check over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.93,0:39:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, better safe than sorry, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.74,0:39:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Be vigilant, guys. We know it's nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.94,0:39:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys. It's 60 feet long.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.44,0:39:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The place is deserted, maybe they went out for supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.79,0:39:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's slightly disturbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.02,0:39:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.39,0:39:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,When they don't like a meal they spit it back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.06,0:39:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.87,0:39:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys. It's just a goat.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.30,0:39:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If these beasts only eat things that look good...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.24,0:39:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,...if I were you Miss Hayes, I'd be very careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.81,0:39:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.01,0:39:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to interrupt, but we got a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.15,0:39:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.05,0:39:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragosh, Victor, stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.89,0:39:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Andrei, hang back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.78,0:40:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes things a little more difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.08,0:40:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tight leash, isn't that what you said? - Let's put Plan B into effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.08,0:40:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And what might that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.72,0:40:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.12,0:40:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand how it sheds so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.16,0:40:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ecdysis. It only happens when the snake grows too large for its skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.86,0:40:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means it's growing pretty damn fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.10,0:40:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Victor, I want you to start putting the supplies in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.20,0:40:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragosh, set up a lookout around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.60,0:40:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Andrei, around the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.07,0:40:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Nick?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.02,0:41:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.49,0:41:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.23,0:41:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.83,0:41:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there! Outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.17,0:41:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.24,0:41:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.78,0:41:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.98,0:41:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come on. Come on. - Go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.72,0:41:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- Get something. Check the jeep. - There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.25,0:41:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick! Get my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.26,0:41:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.36,0:41:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.37,0:41:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.86,0:42:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Cease fire! Cease fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.09,0:42:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanda, help Grozny.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.46,0:42:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinkus, in Grozny's jeep there's a fire extinguisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.40,0:42:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of you follow me. We end this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.20,0:42:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.41,0:42:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's go. Come on. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.11,0:42:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire extinguisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.91,0:42:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.02,0:42:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.39,0:42:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- What? - Sofia. Andrei.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.43,0:42:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.06,0:42:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! Hurry up! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.63,0:42:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Get my bag! - Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.20,0:42:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hurry up! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.17,0:43:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come on! - Just a sec... I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.31,0:43:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Open it up. Quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.91,0:43:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hurry! - Okay. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.44,0:43:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't know which... - Hold him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.28,0:43:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the elastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.48,0:43:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- There. - No, the elastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.01,0:43:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.82,0:43:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- Give me the elastic. - There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.68,0:43:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hold him down. Hold him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.39,0:43:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- Pinch this artery. - I don't know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.82,0:43:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinch off his artery. Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.59,0:43:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I'm doing, Amanda. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.23,0:43:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just put pressure and don't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.03,0:43:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Right here. Don't let go. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.83,0:43:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay? - It's okay, Grozny.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.72,0:43:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, kitty, kitty, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.83,0:43:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.57,0:44:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you hiding, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.71,0:44:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.15,0:44:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- I see it. - Where? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.91,0:44:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Twelve o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.52,0:44:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.75,0:44:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.92,0:44:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- Damn, it's big. - Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.26,0:44:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sofia!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.92,0:44:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sofia!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.73,0:45:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.73,0:45:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Got something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.74,0:45:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.91,0:45:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Put pressure! - I don't feel a pulse!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.78,0:45:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- He doesn't have a pulse. It's over! - Shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.55,0:45:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanda, he is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.39,0:45:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Shut the hell up. Just put... - Amanda, it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.15,0:45:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.29,0:45:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanda, he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.46,0:45:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.53,0:45:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.00,0:46:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.46,0:46:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.16,0:47:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.12,0:47:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You take the cake for leaving without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.29,0:47:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.69,0:47:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- We have to kill it. - Take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.73,0:47:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you wanna do? Grab it by the tail?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.80,0:47:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- We're gonna find this thing. Relax. - It's about time, Hammett.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.10,0:47:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Good to see you too, Nick. Come on. Gather around.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.57,0:47:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- We gotta make a plan. - Hammett.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.44,0:47:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hammett. - Andrei, get the steel case...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.44,0:48:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,...in the back of my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.77,0:48:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Listen up, guys. We've all worked together before.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.84,0:48:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple rules, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.11,0:48:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you see this thing, you unload everything until it stops moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.51,0:48:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And you shoot only for the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.58,0:48:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing else will bring this thing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.79,0:48:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow my lead, I'll take you up this snake's ass. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.82,0:48:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.29,0:48:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a tracking device.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.69,0:48:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor, you, Sofie, Amanda in the jeep.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.96,0:48:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nick, Pinkus, you're with me and Andrei.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.53,0:48:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- I think I'll stay here. - Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.17,0:48:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're gonna miss all the excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.19,0:49:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting close. The signal is becoming stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.23,0:49:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.10,0:49:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.44,0:49:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.80,0:49:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.91,0:49:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stay with them. - I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.34,0:49:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.31,0:49:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This way. Quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.65,0:49:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We got it. I repeat, we got it. Stay on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.92,0:49:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- I am trying. - Try harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.76,0:50:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Andrei, lose the tracker. We're onto him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.19,0:50:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the end of the line for these bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.04,0:50:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, try to keep this car steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.16,0:50:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- You okay? - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.56,0:50:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.57,0:50:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.35,0:50:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.35,0:50:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- It just spit on my face. - You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.32,0:50:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Cover your eye. Go! - Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.12,0:51:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Drive, quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.92,0:51:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where is he? - Go left. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.86,0:51:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.71,0:51:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I think my leg is broken. My leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.12,0:51:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.72,0:51:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.33,0:51:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.50,0:51:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.96,0:51:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sofia?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.83,0:51:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sofia.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.87,0:51:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Amanda? - Do you see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.17,0:51:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanda, I think my leg is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.67,0:51:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Okay. I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.11,0:52:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.41,0:52:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.51,0:52:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanda. You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.11,0:52:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Amanda. - Hammett.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.32,0:52:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hammett.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.76,0:52:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hammett.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.10,0:52:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.08,0:53:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God, just get me out of here. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.42,0:53:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.63,0:54:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey. It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.47,0:54:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't see me. It must be the mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.47,0:54:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- He couldn't sense me. - Where are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.70,0:54:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- They're dead. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.37,0:54:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's catch up with Nick and Andrei. You'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.17,0:55:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.99,0:55:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on. Murdoch called and said I should be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.43,0:55:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- I have no idea why he didn't call. - Do you think it's possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.53,0:55:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Is what possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.73,0:55:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Amanda... - What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.93,0:55:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nothing. - Oh, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.44,0:55:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you guys are here discussing the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.71,0:55:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna give us a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.17,0:55:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Gladly.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.68,0:55:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.01,0:55:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We were discussing the possibilities of bringing this creature down.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.62,0:56:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really? How come I don't believe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.22,0:56:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.92,0:56:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've worked with Pinkus enough to know he's always got an agenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.16,0:56:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,When I see someone I don't trust talking to another I don't trust...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.46,0:56:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...I don't get all warm and fuzzy inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.50,0:56:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where the whiskey comes in, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.11,0:56:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You two vipers can talk business all you want. I'm gonna go call the Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.04,0:56:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, you sure are hot when you're making threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.71,0:56:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not making any threats. I'm gonna go call the Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.41,0:56:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She's hiding something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.12,0:56:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, the Army. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.72,0:56:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure but she knows something.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.95,0:56:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Your fault. - My fault? I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.29,0:56:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- I got a bad feeling about her. - Let's find out what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.53,0:56:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not have a fancy Ph.D., but I know one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.10,0:56:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There ain't a snake on this planet that can skewer people with its tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.10,0:56:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We weren't expecting this much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.04,0:56:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really? - What are you two discussing?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.31,0:56:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Amanda, why don't you tell them. What were we discussing?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.31,0:57:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A serum.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.88,0:57:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. We gave it a serum.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.05,0:57:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sort of a DNA tune-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.75,0:57:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Transgenics.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.42,0:57:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Snakes are the only animals that can tolerate the new serum.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.76,0:57:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We had to find out why.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.69,0:57:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So we altered its DNA...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.66,0:57:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,...in an attempt to isolate the gene that makes it immune to toxicity.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.10,0:57:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And the enormous size of the spike in the tail is because of the drugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.21,0:57:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- We believe the serum is responsible. - Well done, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.28,0:57:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I intended this? We were developing a drug...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.38,0:57:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- that would save lives. - I think you failed there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.48,0:57:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no. We didn't fail. We were on the cusp of a breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.99,0:57:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's a reason why I came along.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.42,0:57:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like where this is going.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.22,0:57:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how it could get any worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.49,0:57:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She's pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.63,0:57:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.73,0:57:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- The female is about to give birth. - When?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.60,0:58:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In less than 24 hours, if not sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.54,0:58:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Normal little snakes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.61,0:58:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the black one.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.81,0:58:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell would you allow something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.25,0:58:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,For research. The offspring would put us closer to perfecting the serum.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.32,0:58:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Serum. And just what was this serum supposed to do besides wreak havoc?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.52,0:58:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A giant step towards the cure for cancer and Alzheimer's disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.26,0:58:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant's the operative word here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.16,0:58:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We can sit and argue about this or we can do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.06,0:58:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,In less than 24 hours this country's gonna be overrun.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.70,0:58:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Give me the SAT phone. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.33,0:58:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Calling the military. - Good call.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.03,0:58:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- You wanna do that? - What else is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.04,0:58:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hold on. Let's hear Hammett out. - Our mission is based on secrecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.67,0:58:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Call the military, we're kissing our paychecks goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.38,0:58:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There are thousands... No, millions of lives at stake here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.21,0:58:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- Make that call. - Wanna go to jail?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.98,0:58:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- I heard transgenics were illegal. - Better 10-by-10 than 6 feet under.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.38,0:58:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right. We're not equipped to deal with this, no way to find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.29,0:58:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I disagree. Our chances are excellent. I know where the snakes are.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.53,0:58:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- How? - I shot one with a tracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.46,0:58:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,One that can't be shed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.73,0:59:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.70,0:59:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,...wanna call in the military?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.63,0:59:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't be here in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.55,0:59:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You better be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.67,0:59:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Coffee? - Sure. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.64,0:59:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.94,0:59:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,...maybe we got off on the wrong foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.18,0:59:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. You've come here to apologize, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.02,0:59:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Actually, I came here to offer you a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.59,1:00:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then, I'd have to question your intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.13,1:00:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.76,1:00:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're the great white hunter and I'm with the Ph.D., remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.14,1:00:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope that you're as good as everybody says you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.71,1:00:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I'm better.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.90,1:00:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.14,1:00:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- The old industrial park. - Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.05,1:01:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- You don't have to go. - One of us needs to stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.49,1:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- You good with that? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.09,1:01:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Be our eyes. If anything changes, let us know immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.16,1:01:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.90,1:02:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.65,1:02:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Pinkus? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.95,1:02:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back and cover us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.19,1:02:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.41,1:03:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're almost right on top of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.99,1:03:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got to be in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.13,1:03:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.07,1:03:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I go high.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.17,1:03:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Low left. - Low right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.28,1:03:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.65,1:04:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.22,1:04:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sofia.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.31,1:04:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinkus.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.95,1:04:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinkus, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.19,1:05:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming this way. I need backup.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.63,1:05:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanda's spotted the snakes. We'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.13,1:05:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave him. There's nothing we can do. Leave him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.74,1:05:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.91,1:05:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw them go this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.23,1:05:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me guess. They swim.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.50,1:05:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.50,1:05:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where they went in.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.60,1:05:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's the temperature of that water? - Forty, maybe 50 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.81,1:05:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, they're cold-blooded, so they can only last, like, 20 or 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.74,1:05:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty minutes. Seven miles an hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.81,1:05:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Puts them on that side of the lake.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.82,1:06:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They would swim until they found a food source.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.85,1:06:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.52,1:06:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.62,1:06:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- She's about to give birth. - What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.06,1:06:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The anaconda lays their young next to an abundant food supply.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.40,1:06:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The city.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.40,1:06:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- What can we do? - Find out where they went.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.47,1:06:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- And we keep tracking. - Keep tracking? Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.04,1:06:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Half our crew is dead. If we had called this in like Amanda...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.01,1:06:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody wanted this, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.54,1:06:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you a bit about the military.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.64,1:06:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They're as reliable as a bottle of Jack at an AA meeting.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.65,1:06:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You are full of it. You've done nothing but get us killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.51,1:06:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me paint you a clearer picture.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.12,1:06:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,In about 12 hours, this entire country is gonna be overrun...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.09,1:06:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...with baby snakes that will eat you and everything in their paths.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.39,1:06:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, we can either find them and stop them or we can call in the military.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.73,1:06:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Call them. - Andrei, give me the SAT phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.80,1:06:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's Hammett.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.17,1:06:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Put me through to Major Reysner.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.07,1:06:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Major, a situation has arisen that requires your urgent assistance.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.81,1:07:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A 100-foot mutated anaconda...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.68,1:07:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,...has escaped a confined facility near Baiton.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.68,1:07:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been tracking it for two days. We lost five men.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.32,1:07:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now our concern is for the local citizens.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.05,1:07:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We need backup ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.69,1:07:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. I'll alert my team.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.63,1:07:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep the SAT phone on and triangulate our position.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.13,1:07:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Andrei, keep it on.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.33,1:07:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone happy?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.10,1:07:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you got two choices.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.27,1:07:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You go home with a great snake story or you go with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.91,1:07:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I intend on getting a nice new pair...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.84,1:07:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,...of anaconda snakeskin boots in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.80,1:07:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Five more minutes, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.57,1:07:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father will be home soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.19,1:08:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.92,1:08:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do you see? - Unnatural patterns in the bushes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.82,1:08:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Patterns in the dirt.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.36,1:08:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Every animal's got his stamp. You just gotta know how to find them.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.46,1:08:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Call the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.40,1:08:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hammett's found the trail. We're heading northwest.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.00,1:08:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Our coordinates are 64982 by 450938. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.81,1:08:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're heading west now.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.65,1:08:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We should intersect Fairago Road...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.25,1:08:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,...about 2.1 kilometers from your location.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.42,1:08:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Assuming that you stay on that heading.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.99,1:08:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds right. Out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.19,1:08:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Turn here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.81,1:09:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.91,1:09:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're less than a quarter mile from our rendezvous?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.41,1:09:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Right. - We have 20 minutes till they get here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.05,1:09:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you getting at?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.35,1:09:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That factory is everything a giant snake would want in a home.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.22,1:09:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We have weapons and the time. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.26,1:09:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.77,1:09:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.97,1:09:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Trail just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.04,1:09:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- It can't just disappear. - Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.27,1:09:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.61,1:09:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The trees.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.85,1:09:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.89,1:09:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.49,1:09:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think God wants us to fail.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.39,1:10:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just yet, pal. Not just yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.06,1:10:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.53,1:10:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, at least we've established a rendezvous.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.60,1:10:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.34,1:10:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.97,1:10:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if there's blood, there's more blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.48,1:10:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.45,1:10:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.65,1:10:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This snake just made our job a hell of a lot easier.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.49,1:10:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.26,1:10:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Did you see that? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.90,1:10:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We got a visual on the snake, 20 degrees west of your location.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.07,1:10:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- Old abandoned power plant. - Try him again.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.24,1:10:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Andrei, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.24,1:10:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- I guess we're on our own. - Give me the biggest gun you have.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.01,1:10:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- How cute. - Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.94,1:10:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This big enough for you. It will have to do for now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.58,1:11:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We're clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.62,1:11:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready for this?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.49,1:11:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even remotely.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.86,1:11:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Attagirl.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.41,1:12:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice apartment.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.55,1:12:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw it come in here, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.49,1:12:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It would've been hard to miss.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.47,1:13:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be the guestroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.94,1:13:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.01,1:13:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we go over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.21,1:13:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.24,1:14:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- The blood, here's the snake's blood. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.57,1:14:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes me feel a lot better.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.19,1:14:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.41,1:15:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.23,1:15:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.87,1:15:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.10,1:16:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You got my back?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.90,1:16:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I got your back.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.07,1:16:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- They're playing hide and seek? - Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.87,1:16:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just rats.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.71,1:17:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only rats.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.35,1:17:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just snake snacks.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.24,1:17:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hammett.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.81,1:17:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it. All right, keep up.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.02,1:17:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.33,1:17:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.20,1:17:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.70,1:17:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.98,1:18:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.18,1:18:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Amanda! Take me out!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.55,1:18:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.75,1:18:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Nick, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.86,1:18:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? No!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.40,1:18:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.84,1:18:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.90,1:18:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.72,1:18:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.73,1:19:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Give me the SAT phone. - We have to help them.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.99,1:19:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You go on ahead. I'm gonna check back.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.16,1:19:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Four miles northeast of location.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.73,1:19:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The old power plant.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.07,1:19:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't miss it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.58,1:19:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Murdoch residence.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.88,1:19:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Mr. Reysner. Please, put me through to Murdoch.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.51,1:19:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a second, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.41,1:19:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Murdoch, Mr. Reysner on line for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.05,1:19:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him, I'll call him back on the other line.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.02,1:19:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.33,1:20:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to call me on any line but this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.77,1:20:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. It won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.74,1:20:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to let you know that everything is going as planned.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.81,1:20:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We're right on schedule.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.14,1:20:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.81,1:20:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No one must know anything about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.14,1:20:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.68,1:20:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make sure our money's in place.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.73,1:20:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.07,1:20:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, I thought you guys were dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.40,1:20:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- Our radio was broken. - Where's Nick?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.41,1:20:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- He's dead and so is the black one. - The queen?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.04,1:20:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- I think it's down that hall. - What's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.78,1:20:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's a slug. - A what?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.98,1:20:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- An infertile membrane, a dead egg. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.05,1:21:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- She's about to start laying. - Then let's finish this and get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.76,1:21:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sixty seconds will give us enough time.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.16,1:21:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll blow this whole place.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.87,1:21:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell? Hammett?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.81,1:21:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite a sight, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.21,1:21:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The miracle of birth.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.01,1:21:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you wanna destroy something so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.48,1:21:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Toss the gun down, soldier girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.32,1:21:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.95,1:21:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think I'd shoot you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.59,1:21:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.83,1:21:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.83,1:21:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.13,1:21:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten million dollars for just one baby snake.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.20,1:21:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're working with Murdoch?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.13,1:21:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not a doctor for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.47,1:21:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no special forces unit, is there?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.57,1:21:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Two for two.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.17,1:22:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just shoot me?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.28,1:22:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you could be a meal.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.58,1:22:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you could take a bullet and be a meal.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.08,1:22:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you could work for a brand-new employer...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.49,1:22:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,...who could use your expertise in continuing the research.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.73,1:22:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You cut me in on the 10 million?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.50,1:22:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Negotiable.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.50,1:22:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.37,1:22:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.58,1:22:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Not!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.85,1:22:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So you wanna play.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.08,1:23:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to be nice to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.90,1:24:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy trails, slimy bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.14,1:24:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your 10 mil's about to go up in flames, Hammett.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.61,1:24:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that's not the only thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.98,1:24:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Good knowing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.74,1:26:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Reysner, you have a package for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.97,1:26:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mr. Murdoch, I have one. I will begin research immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.68,1:26:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You show me proof...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.88,1:26:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,...the money will be wired direct to your account.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.06,0:01:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,放松点,Peter
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.50,0:01:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你预期的那种研究吧,啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.20,0:01:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,放松点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,坐好了慢慢在后面兜风吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.83,0:02:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,射它的头
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.20,0:02:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,上帝!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.98,0:02:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我的胳膊!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.42,0:02:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯,你现在感觉如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.46,0:02:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴你加入,不是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.06,0:02:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾说过想做个有钱人的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵,想做有钱人就要象这个样子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.00,0:02:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴你能好好待着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.69,0:03:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.03,0:03:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝帮帮我们吧.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.29,0:05:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那么,你说的是 Wexel Hall制药公司...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:29.38,Default,,0,0,0 ,,...否认动物基因测试...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:32.32,Default,,0,0,0 ,,...在他们东欧的秘密实验室
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.49,0:05:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上CEO J.D. Murdoch先生亲自联系了Peter...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.43,0:05:39.37,Default,,0,0,0 ,,...意图否认这些传言,我们觉得这就更加证明了...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.53,0:05:43.10,Default,,0,0,0 ,,...泄露的测试内容是罕见的残忍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.40,0:05:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,在不泄露你内线的前提下,你可以再详细一些吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.37,0:05:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我引用及我们的报告:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,"我们所见的试验残忍,邪恶的程度...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.65,0:05:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,...完完全全超出美国人所能的想象"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.29,0:06:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,早安,Murdoch先生.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.86,0:06:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,早安,Murdoch先生.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.53,0:06:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,早安,Murdoch先生.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.08,0:06:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,待在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.71,0:06:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,早安,Murdoch先生.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,握手很能说明一个人, Pinkus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.55,0:06:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是的,先生.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.36,0:06:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,来杯咖啡吗,先生?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.37,0:06:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,废话少说.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.67,0:06:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,消息泄露了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.24,0:06:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,泄露了?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.41,0:06:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,PETA.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.67,0:06:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,善待动物组织的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...向公众发起了调查
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.08,0:07:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的设备在哪及我们到底在做什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.28,0:07:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我也扪心自问, "他们是如何发现我们的?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.02,0:07:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你保证, Murdoch先生.我会找出原因的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.66,0:07:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我是Wexel Hall公司的脸皮.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.29,0:07:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,当脸皮被毁的时候...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.23,0:07:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我也同时被毁. - 我明白,先生.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,更不用说世界上的每个制药公司...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.33,0:07:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,...都想要尽一切办法置我们于死地.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.64,0:07:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以加强安保但如果找不出消息泄露源的话...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那一切都白瞎. - 这是你的活!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,并且你必须把它做好.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.61,0:07:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,否则你就只能给我去肛肠研究部门...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.55,0:07:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,...去研究如何把我的鞋从你的肠子里取出来,明白吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.45,0:07:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是的,先生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,项目的进度如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.82,0:07:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,有些延迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.29,0:07:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,延迟! 我现在可真一点都不吃惊了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哪方面延迟了?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.39,0:07:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kane将回答你所有的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.40,0:07:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kane在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.34,0:07:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这边走,先生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这是活体蟒后养殖间
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.35,0:08:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,根本不动啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我的第一任老婆
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.05,0:08:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,别被她的小憩欺骗了你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.25,0:08:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,她可是有1200磅的粉碎式力量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.52,0:08:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,正如我说的,就像我的第一任老婆
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.46,0:08:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你,Murdoch先生.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.43,0:08:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你下星期才来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,教授,如你所知,我可是个急性子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的人员一直努力工作...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.34,0:08:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,...我也注意了你的时间安排
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.54,0:08:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,很好. 因为为成果付钱的是我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.71,0:08:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,如你所知,我们已经成功的合成和生产...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.14,0:08:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,...血兰提取物.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.61,0:08:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们患者对血清的适应力和那些野生蛇一样...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.72,0:08:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...完全没有副作用
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.39,0:08:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,没有发现衰变.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.65,0:08:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这个合成的血清肯定是有效的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是的,目前只是对蛇来说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.59,0:08:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但这里有些东西你必须看看...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.23,0:08:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,请
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.77,0:09:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这才有点意思.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.11,0:09:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但是告诉我,我们比蛇少了什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.91,0:09:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们目前还无法解释为什么这种提取物对蛇是无害的...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.58,0:09:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,...但对人却是致命的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.32,0:09:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但你告诉我你已经有进展
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是的,我们只是减少,但没有完全去除毒性
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.03,0:09:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 狗和黑猩猩都做了试验 - 还有老鼠.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.36,0:09:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,给老鼠连续注射一定剂量的这种血清...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.86,0:09:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,...衰变的速率降低了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.97,0:09:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但最后,它们还是死了...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.61,0:09:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...因为某些我们也搞不明白的机理吧.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.18,0:09:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Murdoch先生, 这是Darryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.08,0:09:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你好, Darryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.42,0:09:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到您,先生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.85,0:09:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这边,先生 - 不错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.76,0:09:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,非常不错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.79,0:09:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯,现在情况是,Murdoch先生...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.99,0:10:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,...通过培育新一代的兰花...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,...我们制造了第二代血清
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.40,0:10:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们希望能在源头解决这个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.61,0:10:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,看看现代科学的奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.85,0:10:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,看看奇迹?我可什么都没有看见
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.15,0:10:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们通过保持黑暗以给这个东西一种睡眠的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.60,0:10:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,真他妈的够丑的吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.07,0:10:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.33,0:10:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,典型的水蚺
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.50,0:10:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,当然现在它不典型了.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.85,0:10:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我宝宝今天如何? - 又饿了.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.12,0:11:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 笼子里温度多少? - 65.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.69,0:11:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,提高5度.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.39,0:11:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,同时加20立方厘米的混合气体.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.53,0:11:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.73,0:11:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在告诉我这是由常规剂量的血清产生的?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.83,0:11:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,很大程度上, 我们最想看的...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.04,0:11:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,太神奇了,四月前他还可以被装进一个鞋盒呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.14,0:11:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他现在可能也还这么觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.07,0:11:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,制服在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.44,0:11:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯,我知道了,我要去找出原因来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.05,0:11:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上,正好相反
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.88,0:11:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,它变的更大,更快,更强
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.22,0:11:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,还更加卑劣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.38,0:11:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正取得进展, 不过我们需要更大的实验室和更好的安保
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.19,0:11:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我正要说这个问题 - 是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.63,0:11:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Murdoch先生, 我们的爬虫专家Amanda Hayes博士.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.30,0:11:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我向Pinkus提了四个申请.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.36,0:11:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,每次他总是回答 "这不是我说了算的"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.97,0:11:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那么到底谁说了算?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.50,0:11:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,您, Murdoch先生?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.84,0:11:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,请原谅Hayes博士.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.81,0:11:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,她不清楚协议
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我很清楚协议.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.61,0:11:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我做你付钱要我做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.18,0:12:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,在乎一下我们动物的情况和我们自己的安全
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hayes博士.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.95,0:12:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你能给我有市场前景的产品...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...那么我就会给你买下这个半球最大的动物园.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.62,0:12:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在需要更大的设备
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.99,0:12:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我看看我能做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.26,0:12:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须给我大一些的设备 Y你可没有对付过一条60尺...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.66,0:12:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...并且胃口很大的蟒蛇.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.03,0:12:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们根本就没有足够的人手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.17,0:12:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,她说的那个是什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.28,0:12:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思,先生,我还有一些菌要培养
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.42,0:12:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinkus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这没什么的. - 没什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.92,0:12:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我付给你们这么多钱,就是要让研究照计划运行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.73,0:12:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,很显然现在并非如此.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,还要让我再多花一笔不菲的钱去搞定这个专家所说的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.20,0:12:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,钱不是问题
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.64,0:12:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,假如我们停下来更新和扩大...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.47,0:12:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,...我们就要推后几个月.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这的一切都是定制好的. 需要时间.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我少的就是时间.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.19,0:13:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Amanda?借一步说话. - 先生?可以
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.79,0:13:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我上医学院可不是服无期徒刑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.69,0:13:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不过是为了达到目地的一种方式
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.53,0:13:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,谁的目地?为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.93,0:13:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,为了一些生病的亿万富翁能战胜死亡?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.43,0:13:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说他有病是什么意思? - 得了, Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你难道看不出来?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.01,0:13:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,瞳孔放大,皮肤惨白,不停咳嗽?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.74,0:13:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,更别提他体重的急剧下降
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.04,0:13:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我看他得了癌症,也就是说快咯屁了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.11,0:13:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在拯救千万人的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.12,0:13:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你能想象一种药让癌症患者获得新生...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.26,0:13:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...还有能逆转老年痴呆症?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.42,0:13:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的还相信那个?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.93,0:13:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你不相信吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.60,0:13:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.36,0:14:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这本应该蛮好的,为什么就是觉得有什么不对头呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.60,0:14:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你从试验开始的时候就知道我们在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.44,0:14:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是的,不过我觉得应该更负责的去做这些
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.84,0:14:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被一些进展所迷惑了, Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.81,0:14:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,得了,不就是一条大蛇嘛.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.48,0:14:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是的,对,说得蛮轻巧的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.52,0:14:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧,等下和你说,可以吗? - 可以.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,更大,更强,更卑劣,哦?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.70,0:14:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我能用上那个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.07,0:14:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是个好注意,先生.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.14,0:14:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉我是血清导致了这个?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.78,0:14:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,先生? 先生, 把灯关掉.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.35,0:14:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,关掉灯.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.92,0:14:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那鬼地方到底怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.89,0:14:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinkus? 试验间里的警灯狂闪不停了.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.76,0:14:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了? - 我告诉你别那么做的.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.39,0:15:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放毒气. - 怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.96,0:15:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了? - 更多的灯开始闪了.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.73,0:15:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,动作很大
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.83,0:15:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别放毒气! - Darryl, 马上放毒气!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.14,0:15:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你会杀了它的. - 不,我们不会...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.17,0:15:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别放毒气. - 求你了, Darryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.14,0:15:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放毒气,先生,先生! - 我不会让你杀了它的!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.85,0:15:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静. 这仅仅是让蛇安静下来的.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.95,0:15:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟我说...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.38,0:15:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Darryl! Darryl? - 怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.02,0:15:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事了? - Darryl...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.49,0:15:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,看,看,别当心Murdoch先生. 那是3寸厚的有机玻璃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.66,0:15:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,我觉得还不够
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.80,0:15:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-它在做什么? - 大家保持镇定
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.30,0:15:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 毒气会使它安静的. - 你确定?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他会安静的,我确定
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.37,0:15:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,大家镇定点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.85,0:15:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,现在好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.15,0:15:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.05,0:16:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就让他一个蟒待着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.82,0:16:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Darryl, 告诉Kane
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.89,0:16:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,让他知道发生的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.39,0:16:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我去叫技术人员来修理这东西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.37,0:16:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- Darryl. 快按警报器,把我们隔离开 - 快按,快啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.40,0:16:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,下载结果中...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.17,0:16:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都离开.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,保持镇定,所有人马上离开 马上离开
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.18,0:16:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们安全了 - 我们快救救他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.81,0:16:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么? 别管他了 - 他是我朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.61,0:16:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那边可有只大怪兽啊! - 我不管,我得去救他!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.45,0:16:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,就算那蛇不杀了你,那毒气也会毒死你的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.15,0:16:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈给我闭嘴!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.22,0:16:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,我的上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.33,0:16:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 发生什么了? - 你以为呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.10,0:16:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你都做了什么刚才? Darryl哪儿去了?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.16,0:16:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Darryl没有逃出来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.03,0:16:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们快走,马上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.34,0:16:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你刚才不是说毒气可以搞定它吗. - 他在找出口.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.67,0:16:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须控制他,安全小组,关闭通道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.24,0:16:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 全都关闭. - 是的,先生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.78,0:16:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上关闭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.05,0:17:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanda, 拿上枪.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.38,0:17:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿,嘿,嘿,你要去哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.95,0:17:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要带Murdoch离开这里 - 没有人可以离开.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.82,0:17:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的赶紧拿把枪去!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.89,0:17:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 搞什么,我要马上离开 - Pinkus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.66,0:17:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,拿起枪!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.80,0:17:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是演习
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.13,0:17:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人马上离开 去安全的区域
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.64,0:17:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是演习
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.11,0:17:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 镇定剂的药效发作了. - 你确定吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是的. 那些剂量足可以放倒10头犀牛.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.05,0:17:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那只是镇定气,它只能让他昏迷5分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.79,0:17:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,没时间了,大家快带上面罩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.99,0:17:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinkus? 快带Murdoch 先生离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.69,0:17:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好的,好的,先生?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.96,0:17:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是演习
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.93,0:17:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人马上离开,到安全的区域去.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.47,0:17:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快走. - T这不是演习
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.31,0:18:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人马上撤离到安去的区域去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.61,0:18:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有看见Janet吗? 她出来了吗? - 她已经走了.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.95,0:18:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是演习
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.61,0:18:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人马上撤离到指定的安全区域
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.22,0:18:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是演习
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.09,0:18:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人马上撤离到指定的安全区域
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.77,0:18:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是演习
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.50,0:18:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人马上撤离到指定的安全区域
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.54,0:18:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是演习
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.78,0:18:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是演习
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.41,0:18:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.39,0:18:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是演习
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.62,0:18:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人马上撤离到指定的安全区域
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.96,0:18:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.70,0:18:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.46,0:18:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是Darryl. - 所有人马上...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.60,0:19:01.86,Default,,0,0,0 ,,...到指定的安全区域
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.04,0:19:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗? - 快.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.44,0:19:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让我们度过这关. - 这不是演习
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.81,0:19:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人马上撤离到指定的安全区域
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.61,0:19:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,它在哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,在附近?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.41,0:19:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是演习.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.28,0:19:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所有人马上撤离... - 它在哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.49,0:19:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,..到指定的安全区域
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.05,0:19:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.66,0:19:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他不在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.36,0:19:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他会去哪里? - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.13,0:19:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们最好快点找到他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.63,0:19:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定去找蟒后了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.16,0:19:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走 - 快
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是演习,所有人马上离...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.37,0:19:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那个我们怎么解释,啊,Pinkus?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.41,0:19:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,别告诉我你们连后备照明系统都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.15,0:19:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,请不要告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.55,0:19:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,马上就会恢复的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.28,0:19:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们赶紧离开这里 赶紧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.44,0:20:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.21,0:20:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我真希望你没有在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.58,0:20:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.95,0:20:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Susan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,不,她死了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.59,0:21:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他救了她出去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.52,0:21:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这全是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.57,0:21:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.04,0:22:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你知不知道我们要花多少代价来隐瞒这些
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.55,0:22:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是的...不
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.82,0:22:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我想说...是的,我知道...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.42,0:22:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把这里清理干净!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.15,0:22:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,别留下任何痕迹
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.19,0:22:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,先生,我觉得我们可以挽回
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.13,0:22:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有安全小组在现场这里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.79,0:22:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,一队追踪专家也正赶来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.53,0:22:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,做你所有该做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.67,0:22:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你要一天24小时和他们在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.64,0:22:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么意思? - 你是监理, Pinkus.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.54,0:22:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,监督好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.04,0:23:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,否则,我也让你成为这血清的试验品
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.98,0:23:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但是,先生,我不作现场工作
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.95,0:23:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinkus随时告诉我情况.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.89,0:23:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的情况. - Pinkus.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.59,0:23:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我是Grozny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.66,0:23:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你每小时向我汇报直到我听到好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.20,0:23:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是,先生
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.54,0:23:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Grozny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.14,0:23:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.01,0:23:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你简要说一下情况
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.52,0:23:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,得了,哥们,开了五枪才搞定他们
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.59,0:23:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你20%的市场价
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.83,0:23:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,听着,哥们,我才不吊你们有什么牛逼的计划
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.86,0:24:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,但这是五磅重的爪哇犀牛角
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.23,0:24:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我建议你去找个ATM取款机
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.50,0:24:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,做些有意思的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.47,0:24:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,三万,否则没门
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.19,0:24:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,成交
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.83,0:24:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,乐意效劳
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.97,0:24:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,合作愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.81,0:24:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,把信给我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.51,0:24:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧,我刚刚拿的可是三万美金
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.71,0:24:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,假如你们需要欧元的话,得去希腊或者银行兑换了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.68,0:24:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我也常搞混
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.45,0:24:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我... 有电话
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.99,0:25:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,喂? Pinkus?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.13,0:25:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在有点忙
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.96,0:25:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.90,0:25:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,让我猜猜看
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.63,0:25:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定没有把笼子加固好,那蟒蛇逃跑了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.67,0:25:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,情况严重了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.94,0:25:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会给你开个好价,希望你回来领导这个队伍
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.88,0:25:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好的,我尽快
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.68,0:25:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.68,0:25:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么? - Florin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.38,0:25:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Florin?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.92,0:25:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你的电话. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.47,0:25:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,打猎前要先了解猎物
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.72,0:26:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是独一无二的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.43,0:26:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 长到了有60尺长 - 60尺的蛇?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.43,0:26:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我也有一条大家伙 - 想都别想
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.27,0:26:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,请安静!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.94,0:26:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他们又快又强
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.17,0:26:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们以前从没有接触过这样的生物, 请你们务必提高警觉
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.45,0:26:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须搞定他们
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.05,0:26:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,必须
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.92,0:26:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们远长于60尺... - 谢谢, Hayes博士.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.45,0:26:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我会处理好的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.25,0:26:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我的战队了解这个森林就像了解他们自家的后院一样
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.59,0:26:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,可能更简单,我们甚至知道他们的藏身处
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.06,0:26:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们总是实时记录我们的研究成果
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.23,0:26:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,以防万一
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.70,0:26:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,10分钟后出发
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.10,0:26:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hammett's在路上了 我们应该等他
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.14,0:26:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能等,尤其是我们已经知道蛇躲在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.17,0:26:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要速战速绝
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.04,0:26:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,如我所说,10分钟后出发.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.71,0:26:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 伙计,他想独吞功劳 - 说对了.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.01,0:27:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你也知道他怎么看Hammett.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.92,0:27:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 你们都听到了.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.28,0:27:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,10分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.99,0:27:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要单独和你谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.12,0:27:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不通知政府?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.19,0:27:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,公司想私下处理好这个事件
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.49,0:27:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,公司根本就不明白我们所面对的是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.73,0:27:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我不用提醒你,你是签过保密协议的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.70,0:27:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,开始那些无辜的人需要了解这些情况
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.37,0:27:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的专家会快速高效得处理好这些事
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.91,0:27:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,对了,我还想给你作为朋友的一个忠告
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.51,0:27:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,别插手这个事
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.01,0:27:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那些动物是我的责任
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.21,0:27:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,每人比我更了解他们的习性
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.22,0:27:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那些蟒蛇可不会为你在地上打滚
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.82,0:27:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我要和你一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.23,0:27:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你是没有应付过一条60尺且胃口超大的蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.53,0:27:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们根本人手就不够
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.14,0:27:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你能想象一种药物让癌症患者获得新生...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.27,0:28:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,...还可以逆转老年痴呆症?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.17,0:28:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的相信吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.51,0:28:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你不信?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.08,0:28:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,别介意Hayes博士.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.08,0:28:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,她并不熟悉协议
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.52,0:28:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hayes小姐?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.12,0:28:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hayes小姐?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.03,0:28:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.73,0:28:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢轻装旅行?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.37,0:28:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我带这个不会舒服的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.57,0:28:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你会感觉舒服的...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.20,0:28:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,...如果你面对的是一条60尺的大蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.94,0:28:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾经面对过,记得吗? 我帮忙创造了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.11,0:28:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是今天你们出现在这里的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.38,0:28:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想给你们逃生提供最好的服务
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.48,0:28:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题, Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.55,0:28:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,只要一直和Nick呆在一起.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.72,0:28:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nick?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.52,0:28:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,把火箭筒介绍给她.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.49,0:28:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,火箭筒
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.63,0:28:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,24场KO, 地区总冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.51,0:29:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我能再看一下那枪吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.35,0:29:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,对不起.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.49,0:29:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道, Dragosh...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.53,0:29:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,...他们都说永远不要去直视他们.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.40,0:29:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,还有呢?还有什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.83,0:29:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会催眠
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.50,0:29:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 胡扯 - 不,不,不,这是真的!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.51,0:29:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我听过一个故事说一个猎人盯着一条水蚺太久
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.81,0:29:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,突然,他就被催眠了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.18,0:29:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,它生吞了他
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.35,0:29:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我把这把来复枪塞进你的喉咙吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.86,0:29:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,别乱说了, Andrei. 你知道他怕蛇的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.59,0:30:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我不怕,我只是不喜欢他们罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.06,0:30:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用喜欢他们,你只要喜欢去杀他们就可以
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.37,0:30:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,很乐意
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.52,0:30:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,天杀的狼!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.48,0:35:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们靠近了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.15,0:35:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 找到了 - 跟上他们
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.12,0:36:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,信号就来自这附近
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.26,0:36:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,它可能在100码以内的任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.16,0:36:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会感知热量,所以你们要随时做好战斗的准备
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.90,0:36:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,千万别忘了!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.60,0:36:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nick? Andrei? 看看谁在屋子里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.34,0:36:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dragosh, 检查一下农场. - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.20,0:36:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你两,绕到后面去. - 走.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.04,0:36:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,来,咱们走
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.74,0:36:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们呢? - Pinkus先生.Hayes小姐.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.95,0:36:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,就呆在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.81,0:36:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 如果他们来过这里,你会发现一些痕迹的 - 对,你说的完全对
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.29,0:36:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我们四处找
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.22,0:36:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Grozny.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.09,0:36:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能需要这个
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.89,0:36:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.61,0:36:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨?有人在家吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.78,0:37:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈罗? -试试门.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.59,0:37:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,没有锁
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.12,0:37:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.72,0:37:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就像草原上的小屋
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.27,0:38:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去检查一下后面
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.75,0:38:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.65,0:38:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,...对教授的死很遗憾.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.25,0:38:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个好人
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.12,0:38:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是的,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.56,0:38:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragosh, 它显示我们靠近了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.50,0:38:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,睁大你的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.53,0:38:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,检查完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.44,0:38:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,听着,我要进去,我不想等了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.14,0:38:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你绕到后面,我走前面
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.01,0:38:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.74,0:38:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,去检查一下那里
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.93,0:39:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿,安全还是比说对不起好点吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.74,0:39:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,警惕点,伙计们 我们知道它就在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.94,0:39:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧,伙计,它可有60尺呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.44,0:39:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这里没人,可能出去运东西什么的了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.79,0:39:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.02,0:39:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.39,0:39:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会吐出他们不喜欢的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.06,0:39:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我会吃了它
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.87,0:39:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧,伙计,只是一只羊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.30,0:39:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,假如那些野兽只吃看起来好吃的食物...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.24,0:39:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,...加入我是你,Hayes小姐, 我会更小心的.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.81,0:39:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.01,0:39:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我无意打断,不过我们还有活要做
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.15,0:39:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,来这里.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.05,0:39:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragosh, Victor, 呆在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.89,0:39:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Andrei, 退后.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.78,0:40:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这让事情有点更难办了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.08,0:40:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看好了,这不是你说的吗? - 看来我们要实施B计划了.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.08,0:40:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么计划?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.72,0:40:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我还不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.12,0:40:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白为什么它这么快蜕皮
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.16,0:40:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,蜕皮,只有蛇在长大后皮太小了才会的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.86,0:40:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,就是说它长得他妈见鬼的快
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.10,0:40:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧. Victor, 我要你把所需物资都准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.20,0:40:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragosh, 在附近站岗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.60,0:40:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Andrei, 绕到后面
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.07,0:40:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Nick?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.02,0:41:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,上帝,不
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.49,0:41:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住他,上,上
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.23,0:41:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住他
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.83,0:41:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那里,在外面!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.17,0:41:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,上!上!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.24,0:41:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉这个狗娘养的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.78,0:41:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,上 上 上!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.98,0:41:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-快!快! - 上 上
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.72,0:41:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拿点什么来,去吉普车里找找啊. - 它在那
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.25,0:41:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,快,拿我的包来.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.26,0:41:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,快去拿!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.36,0:41:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他怎么样了?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.37,0:41:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.86,0:42:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,停火!停火!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.09,0:42:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanda, 救救Grozny.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.46,0:42:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinkus,在 Grozny的吉普车里有个灭火器
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.40,0:42:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的跟我来 我们来结束这一切.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.20,0:42:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,快.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.41,0:42:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来,快. - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.11,0:42:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,灭火器
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.91,0:42:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,快点!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.02,0:42:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,停!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.39,0:42:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - Sofia. Andrei.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.43,0:42:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.06,0:42:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,快! 快点! 过来!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.63,0:42:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拿我的包来! - 它在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.20,0:42:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点! - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.17,0:43:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点! - 等... 来了.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.31,0:43:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,快打开它
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.91,0:43:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快! - 好的等下.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.44,0:43:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不知道是哪个... - 按住他.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.28,0:43:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,给我橡皮带
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.48,0:43:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给. - 不是,橡皮带.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.01,0:43:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.82,0:43:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给我橡皮带 - 这,给
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.68,0:43:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,现在按住他,按住他
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.39,0:43:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 捏住动脉. - 我不知道要怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.82,0:43:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,按住他动脉按住那里!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.59,0:43:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道我该怎么做, Amanda. 我真不知道.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.23,0:43:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,就按住就可以,不要放手
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.03,0:43:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就这,不要放手 - 好好.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.83,0:43:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可以吗? - 没事的, Grozny.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.72,0:43:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这, 小猫咪,小猫咪,小猫咪.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.83,0:43:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.57,0:44:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你藏在哪里了啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.71,0:44:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,快出来.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.15,0:44:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我看见它了 - 哪?在哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.91,0:44:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,12点方向
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.52,0:44:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.75,0:44:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那里
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.92,0:44:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 靠.真他妈大 - 上!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.26,0:44:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sofia!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.92,0:44:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sofia!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.73,0:45:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,快出来.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.73,0:45:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我有东西给你
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.74,0:45:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那可不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.91,0:45:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 压住! - 我感觉不到脉搏了!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.78,0:45:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他没有脉搏了,结束了! - 闭上你的鸟嘴!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.55,0:45:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanda, 他死了!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.39,0:45:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴. 就压着... - Amanda, 结束了!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.15,0:45:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不,快醒醒,快醒醒
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.29,0:45:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanda, 他已经死了.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.46,0:45:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,醒醒.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.53,0:45:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,醒醒.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.00,0:46:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.46,0:46:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,快点.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.16,0:47:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.12,0:47:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我没来你们就自己开搞了啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.29,0:47:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我的主意
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.69,0:47:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们必须杀了它 - 别紧张!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.73,0:47:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你想做什么? 抓住它的尾巴?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.80,0:47:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们要先找到那东西,放松. - 是时候了, Hammett.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.10,0:47:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴再次见到你, Nick. 快,大家集合
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.57,0:47:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们制定一个计划. - Hammett.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.44,0:47:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hammett. - Andrei, 拿出那个铁箱子...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.44,0:48:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,...在我车的后备箱.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.77,0:48:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好了,听着,伙计们.我们以前都合作过的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.84,0:48:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,简单的规则,明白?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.11,0:48:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你一旦看到那东西,不要做任何事直到它不动了.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.51,0:48:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,然后只冲它的头开火
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.58,0:48:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,打其他地方都是没有用的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.79,0:48:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,跟随我,我就会带领你们把这个蛇干掉! 好了,咱们走
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.82,0:48:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.29,0:48:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,追踪装置
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.69,0:48:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor, 你, Sofie, Amanda 上这吉普车里.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.96,0:48:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nick, Pinkus,你们和我和 Andrei在一起.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.53,0:48:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我想我还是呆这里 - 随你便.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.17,0:48:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但你会错过很多精彩时刻的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.19,0:49:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们接近了,信号越来越强了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.23,0:49:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.10,0:49:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,快!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.44,0:49:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,别让它跑了.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.80,0:49:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.91,0:49:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟好他们. - 我在努力!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.34,0:49:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,快点!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.31,0:49:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这边,快
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.65,0:49:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们找到了,重复,我们找到了.跟好它
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.92,0:49:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我在努力 - 那就更努力些
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.76,0:50:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Andrei, 放下追踪器,我们跟上它了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.19,0:50:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这个狗娘养的死期就要到了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.04,0:50:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,操,把车试着开稳点
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.16,0:50:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-你还好把? - 多谢.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.56,0:50:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,别客气
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.57,0:50:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么可能?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.35,0:50:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这在灼烧我!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.35,0:50:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它刚刚喷到我的脸. - 你怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.32,0:50:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 捂好你的眼睛,上! - 他在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.12,0:51:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,快开,快.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.92,0:51:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他在哪里? - 左边,走.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.86,0:51:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这灼烧着我的脸.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.71,0:51:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我的腿断了,我的腿.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.12,0:51:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.72,0:51:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.33,0:51:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.50,0:51:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.96,0:51:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sofia?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.83,0:51:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sofia.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.87,0:51:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Amanda? - 你看到他了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.17,0:51:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanda,我想我的腿断了.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.67,0:51:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好的,好的,我来了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.11,0:52:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我的腿
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.41,0:52:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.51,0:52:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanda. 你还好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.11,0:52:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Amanda. - Hammett.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.32,0:52:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hammett.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.76,0:52:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hammett.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.10,0:52:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,天啊,不 不 不!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.08,0:53:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,天啊,帮我离开这里,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.42,0:53:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.63,0:54:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿 现在没事了,没事了.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.47,0:54:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是我身上的泥让它看不到我
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.47,0:54:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它感觉不到我 - 其他人在哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.70,0:54:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-都死了 - 好了没事了.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.37,0:54:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要跟上Nick和Andrei. 你会没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.17,0:55:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我都做了些什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.99,0:55:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道是怎么回事Murdoch打电话叫我过来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.43,0:55:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我真不明白你为什么不早点打给我?. - 你觉得可能吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.53,0:55:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,什么可能吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.73,0:55:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Amanda... - 怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.93,0:55:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没什么 - 哦,真的.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.44,0:55:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,像你们这样的家伙难道会在这里谈论天气吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.71,0:55:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,能给我们几分钟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.17,0:55:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.68,0:55:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.01,0:55:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是在谈论是否可能制服他们
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.62,0:56:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,真的? 我怎么就是不信呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.22,0:56:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本就不怎么了解我
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.92,0:56:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我和Pinkus一起工作的时间足够长到让我 知道他总有小算盘的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.16,0:56:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,当我看到一个我不相信的人 和另一个我不相信的人谈论的时候...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.46,0:56:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...我可高兴不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.50,0:56:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我真不知道要怎么说,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.11,0:56:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两小丑慢慢聊,我要去通知军方了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.04,0:56:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的,你威胁人的时候很惹火的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.71,0:56:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我根本没威胁你 我只不过要通知军方罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.41,0:56:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,她在隐藏着什么重要的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.12,0:56:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的,军方. - 你什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.72,0:56:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我不确定她到底都知道了些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.95,0:56:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你的错 - 我的错?我可不这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.29,0:56:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我对她没有好感觉 - 咱们去把事情问个明白
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.53,0:56:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能没有见鬼的博士学位, 但我知道一点
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.10,0:56:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这个星球上根本没有用尾巴就可以刺穿人的蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.10,0:56:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有料到有这么多麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.04,0:56:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的? - 你们在谈论什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.31,0:56:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, Amanda,为什么你不告诉他们, 我们在谈论什么
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.31,0:57:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,一种血清
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.88,0:57:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好了,我们给它注射了一种血清
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.05,0:57:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,一种转基因的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.75,0:57:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就是转基因
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.42,0:57:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,蛇是唯一能适应这种血清的动物
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.76,0:57:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要找出为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.69,0:57:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,于是我们转化它的DNA...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.66,0:57:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,...试图把它免疫毒性的基因分离出来
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.10,0:57:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,而它尾巴上的大钉子就是那些药物的副产品?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.21,0:57:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们相信是血清引起的. - 干得不错,博士.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.28,0:57:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为我是故意得?我们在制造一种...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.38,0:57:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可以拯救生命的药物 - 我想你们失败了.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.48,0:57:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不,不,我们没有失败 我们即将取得重大突破
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.99,0:57:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但我来这里还有原因
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.42,0:57:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢这样
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.22,0:57:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我想情况不会比这更糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.49,0:57:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,她怀孕了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.63,0:57:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我错了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.73,0:57:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 母蛇就要产卵了. - 何时?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.60,0:58:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,24小时内,可能更快
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.54,0:58:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,普通的小蛇,时吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.61,0:58:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,想黑色的那条
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.81,0:58:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈的怎么能让这样的事情发生?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.25,0:58:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,为了研究,那些后代可以让免疫血清更完美
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.32,0:58:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,血清,除了破坏这些血清还有什么用?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.52,0:58:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,为功课癌症和老年痴呆 迈进一大步
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.26,0:58:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,一大步是个很关键的词哦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.16,0:58:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是坐下来争论 还是采取措施补救
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.06,0:58:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,24小时内这个国家就要遭殃了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.70,0:58:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给我卫星电话. - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.33,0:58:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 打电话给军队. - 好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.03,0:58:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想这么做? - 我们还能做什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.04,0:58:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等等让Hammett把话说完 - 我们的任务是秘密的.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.67,0:58:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,叫来军队, 我们可就要吻别支票了.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.38,0:58:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,有上千... 不,上百万人命处在危险中
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.21,0:58:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 打电话. - 想进监狱吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.98,0:58:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我听说转基因是违法的 - 坐牢总比杀人好.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.38,0:58:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,她是对的,我们没有受过这种训练,没有办法找到他们
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.29,0:58:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我不同意,我们有很好的机会 我知道蛇在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.53,0:58:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道? - 我射了一个追踪器在他们中的一条身上.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.46,0:58:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是不会随蜕皮掉落的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.73,0:59:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,另外...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.70,0:59:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,...还想叫军队吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.63,0:59:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不可能及时到达
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.55,0:59:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.67,0:59:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 咖啡? - 好的,谢谢.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.64,0:59:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,看...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.94,0:59:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,...也许我们有点出师不利
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.18,0:59:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,我知道了.你来这里忏悔的,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.02,0:59:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不,事实是我来给你一份工作做
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.59,1:00:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,那我就不得不怀疑你的智商了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.13,1:00:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.76,1:00:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你是伟大的白人猎人,我是博士,还记得吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.14,1:00:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是希望你跟大家所说的一样优秀
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.71,1:00:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不,我比他们说的还要棒
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.90,1:00:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.14,1:00:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老工业园区 - 好,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.05,1:01:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不比去. - 我们中间有一个需要留下.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.49,1:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没问题把? - 当然.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.09,1:01:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我们盯着,要是有情况第一时间告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.16,1:01:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.90,1:02:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,往前走
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.65,1:02:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Pinkus? - 嗯.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.95,1:02:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,呆后面掩护我们,好吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.19,1:02:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.41,1:03:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你们很接近它了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.99,1:03:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,它就在里面
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.13,1:03:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.07,1:03:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我负责上面
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.17,1:03:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 左下. - 右下
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.28,1:03:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,1,2,3
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.65,1:04:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,不
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.22,1:04:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sofia.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.31,1:04:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinkus.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.95,1:04:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinkus, 坚持住.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.19,1:05:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他们向这边来了,我需要支援
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.63,1:05:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanda看到蛇了 我们就来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.13,1:05:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃他,我们无能为力,放弃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.74,1:05:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.91,1:05:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见他们朝这边走了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.23,1:05:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,让我猜猜,他们会游泳.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.50,1:05:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不幸,技术还很牛
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.50,1:05:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是他们跑掉的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.60,1:05:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 水温多少? - 40,或者50.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.81,1:05:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,很好,他们是冷血动物,所以他们最多只能维持 20-30分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.74,1:05:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,30分钟,7英里每小时.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.81,1:05:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,够他们游到湖的另一边
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.82,1:06:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会一直游 直到找到食物
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.85,1:06:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这个意味着...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.52,1:06:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.62,1:06:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她马上就要生了. - 你在说什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.06,1:06:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,蟒蛇会把卵产在有充足食物的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.40,1:06:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那座城市
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.40,1:06:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们该怎么做? - 把他们找出来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.47,1:06:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们继续追踪. - 继续?你疯了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.04,1:06:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们小队咯屁一半了 加入我们听Amanda叫军队的话...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.01,1:06:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人想这样的,兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.54,1:06:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,让我跟你说是军队把
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.64,1:06:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他们跟戒酒协会的见面会上的啤酒一样不可靠
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.65,1:06:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是你不可靠 你除了让我们咯屁还能做什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.51,1:06:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,让我给你描述一下
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.12,1:06:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,12小时后,整个国家都要遭殃了...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.09,1:06:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...小蛇会把你和敢挡他们道的任何东西吃光光
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.39,1:06:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,现在,我们可以找到并且阻止他们, 或者打电话叫军队来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.73,1:06:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 叫军队 - Andrei, 给我卫星电话
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.80,1:06:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,喂, 我是Hammett.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.17,1:06:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我接一下Reysner少校.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.07,1:06:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,少校,有个紧急情况,需要你的支援
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.81,1:07:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,一条长100尺的变种巨蟒...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.68,1:07:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,...从Baiton附近的禁区逃跑了.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.68,1:07:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们追踪了2天,被干掉了5个人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.32,1:07:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们当心会波及当地居民
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.05,1:07:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要马上支援.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.69,1:07:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢,我会通知我的队伍
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.63,1:07:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我会开着卫星电话来确定我们的方位
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.13,1:07:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Andrei, 让电话一直开着
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.33,1:07:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,都满意了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.10,1:07:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,现在,你有两个选择
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.27,1:07:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,带着巨蟒故事回家 或者跟我来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.91,1:07:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我打算明天做一双...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.84,1:07:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,...漂亮的蟒皮新靴子来穿穿.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.80,1:07:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,还有五分钟,宝贝.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.57,1:07:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你老爸就要回到家了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.19,1:08:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到你了.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.92,1:08:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你看到了什么? - 灌木丛有点反常.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.82,1:08:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,泥土里有图案.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.36,1:08:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,所有队伍都有他们自己的脚印 只要你知道怎么找
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.46,1:08:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,通知其他人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.40,1:08:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hammett找到踪迹了,我们正朝西北前进
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.00,1:08:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们坐标是64982 450938.完毕.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.81,1:08:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正朝西走
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.65,1:08:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在菲尔雷葛路会合...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.25,1:08:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,...大约离你们2.1公里
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.42,1:08:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,按照你们前进的方向.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.99,1:08:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好的,完毕
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.19,1:08:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好的,这里转弯
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.81,1:09:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.91,1:09:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,离我们会合点不到1/4英里了?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.41,1:09:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对. - 他们到这里还要20分钟.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.05,1:09:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.35,1:09:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那个工厂正是巨蟒要产卵的地方.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.22,1:09:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有武器和时间,我们上
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.26,1:09:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好,一起去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.77,1:09:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.97,1:09:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,踪迹消失了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.04,1:09:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不可能突然消失的. - 是是,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.27,1:09:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,它一定就在附近
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.61,1:09:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,树上.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.85,1:09:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,小心!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.89,1:09:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧? - 还好.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.49,1:09:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但我想老天想要我们失败
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.39,1:10:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,还不是,伙计,还不是.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.06,1:10:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 你不是在开玩笑吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.53,1:10:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,至少我们已经确定了会合的地点
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.60,1:10:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们离开这个鬼地方
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.34,1:10:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你瞧瞧这个
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.97,1:10:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,哇,假如这是血,那将有更多的血
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.48,1:10:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们找找看.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.45,1:10:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.65,1:10:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这条蛇让我们追踪起来他妈的简单多了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.49,1:10:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.26,1:10:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你看见了吗? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.90,1:10:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们看到蛇了 在你西边20度.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.07,1:10:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 旧废弃电厂. - 再呼叫一次.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.24,1:10:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Andrei, 听到请回答?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.24,1:10:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我猜只能靠自己了 - 把最大的枪拿来.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.01,1:10:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真精致. - 开玩笑.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.94,1:10:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这把够大了吧,关键时刻就靠它了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.58,1:11:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,安全
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.62,1:11:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗你?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.49,1:11:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,还差得远呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.86,1:11:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好女孩
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.41,1:12:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好公寓
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.55,1:12:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们看到它进来了,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.49,1:12:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,它跑不了了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.47,1:13:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这里一定是会客厅
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.94,1:13:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.01,1:13:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到那边去
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.21,1:13:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.24,1:14:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 血,这里有蛇血. - 对
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.57,1:14:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这让我感觉好多了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.19,1:14:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那里更多
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.41,1:15:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,等等,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.23,1:15:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,安全
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.87,1:15:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,安全
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.10,1:16:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你掩护我?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.90,1:16:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我掩护你
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.07,1:16:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们在玩捉迷藏? - 小心!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.87,1:16:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那只是老鼠.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.71,1:17:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那只是老鼠
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.35,1:17:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,只是蛇得点心
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.24,1:17:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hammett.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.81,1:17:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那里,对了,跟上.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.02,1:17:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,它哪里去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.33,1:17:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.20,1:17:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,等等,停下!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.70,1:17:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.98,1:18:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,向我开枪.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.18,1:18:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的, Amanda! 把我弄出去!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.55,1:18:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你在做什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.75,1:18:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Nick,不要!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.86,1:18:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你在做什么? 不要!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.40,1:18:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不! 别这么做!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.84,1:18:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我到底做了什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.90,1:18:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.72,1:18:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,快!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.73,1:19:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把卫星电话给我. - 我们得救他们.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.99,1:19:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你先走,我要打电话检查一下.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.16,1:19:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,东北4英里的方位
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.73,1:19:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,旧废弃电厂
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.07,1:19:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会错过它的 .
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.58,1:19:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Murdoch寓所.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.88,1:19:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我是Reysner先生. 请帮我接通Murdoch先生.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.51,1:19:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等,先生
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.41,1:19:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Murdoch先生, Reysner先生有电话找你
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.05,1:19:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉它,我用另一条线回给他
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.02,1:19:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是,先生
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.33,1:20:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你除了这条线其他都可以打.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.77,1:20:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉,不会再发生了.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.74,1:20:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你知道一切都照计划进行
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.81,1:20:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,一切尽在掌握
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.14,1:20:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.81,1:20:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不要让其他人知道
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.14,1:20:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.68,1:20:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,只管准备好付给我们的钱就可以了.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.73,1:20:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,老天
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.07,1:20:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,我的上帝 我以为你们已经死了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.40,1:20:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们的无线电坏了 - Nick哪儿去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.41,1:20:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他和黑蛇同归于尽了. - 蟒后呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.04,1:20:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我想它从走廊下去了. - 这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.78,1:20:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 蛇卵的壳 - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.98,1:20:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一张枯萎的外膜,一粒已死的蛇卵. - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.05,1:21:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她要开始产卵了. - 那就让我们做个了结然后离开
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.76,1:21:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,60秒,留给我们的时间足够
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.16,1:21:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们把这里一锅端了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.87,1:21:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的怎么回事? Hammett?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.81,1:21:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,很壮观,不是吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.21,1:21:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,奇迹的诞生日
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.01,1:21:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能相信你要毁掉如此美丽的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.48,1:21:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,放下枪,女兵
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.32,1:21:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.95,1:21:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为我不会开枪吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.59,1:21:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,真棒
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.83,1:21:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本就不知道自己在做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.83,1:21:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.13,1:21:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,一千万美金一条幼蛇
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.20,1:21:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你在给Murdoch干活?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.13,1:21:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你还不笨
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.47,1:21:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,也不会有特种兵来,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.57,1:21:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,说对了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.17,1:22:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不开枪?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.28,1:22:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,你可以给蛇做点心.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.58,1:22:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,或者带颗子弹做点心
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.08,1:22:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,右或者为全新的老板工作...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.49,1:22:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,...谁可以利用你的专业技术来继续开展研究
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.73,1:22:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,一千万美金有我的一份吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.50,1:22:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,可以考虑
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.50,1:22:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.37,1:22:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.58,1:22:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,做梦!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.85,1:22:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那么你是想玩玩了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.08,1:23:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我试着对你温柔点
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.90,1:24:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,狗日的,臭婊子
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.14,1:24:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你的一千万就要变成灰烬了 Hammett.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.61,1:24:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你也一样
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.98,1:24:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.74,1:26:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Reysner,你有包裹要给我吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.97,1:26:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是的Murdoch先生, 有一个.我会立刻着手研究
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.68,1:26:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,给我看看证据...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.88,1:26:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,...我就把钱直接汇到你帐号.
